214,000 expected. With macro signals mixed, let's look at how we're applying that caution in today's

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:39.020
simulated trade. Fed speakers emphasizing the duration of the balance sheet over its size

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:45.680
point to a refined approach for fixed income allocation. Duration mismatch between the Fed's holdings

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:51.760
and outstanding treasuries directly influences term premia. Investors can adjust by extending

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:58.080
latter maturities when real rates compress. This matters today because rising inflation expectations

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:02.780
