Implement by screening for intermediate duration ETFs on platforms like Questrade using the

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:17.100
5-10-year treasury segment and rebalancing quarterly against your RRSP target. The approach worked

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:24.560
best in 2022-2023 when duration-driven volatility rewarded those who shortened exposure ahead of

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:31.280
policy shifts. Risk lies in misjudging inflation persistence, which could extend drawdowns.

