00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:28.600
without volume confirmation above the 20-day average. Now, speaking of how duration management

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:35.920
fits into broader allocation, here is the strategy spotlight. Duration mismatch between the Fed's holdings

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:42.700
and outstanding treasuries directly influences term premia. So investors can adjust by extending

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:49.160
latter maturities when real rates compress. Rising inflation expectations could make standing still

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:56.040
